        "Content": "Murphy and Sons Auctioneers are delighted to bring to the Market this excellent 2 Bed Ground Floor Apartment.\r\n\r\nThe property has excellent views of the River Falls.\r\n\r\nLocated in the highly regarded well managed Mill Falls development in the heart of Collooney town.\r\n\r\nManagement fee approx. €699 per annum.\r\n\r\nViewing highly recommended."
      },
      {
