        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Hall - \r\nStorage\nHot press\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining/Livingroom - 7.3m x 3.8m \r\nFully Fitted Kitchen\nStainless steel sink unit\nTiled back splash\nTiled Floor\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 3.6m x 2.6m \r\nBuilt in Wardrobe\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 3.6m x 3.0m \r\nBuilt in Wardrobe\nEnsuite:  (1.8 m x 1.7 m)\nShower, WHB, & WC.\r\n\r\nBathroom - 2.3m x 1.8m \r\nShower, WHB & WC.\nTiled Floor.\r\n\r\n"
